      "orig": "An LCA was developed according to the ISO standards [23,24] and Food and Agriculture Organization of the United Nations (FAO) Livestock Environmental Assessment Protocol guidelines [25]. All procedures were approved by the ‘Comissão de Ética no Uso de Animais’ (CEUA/UDESC) on September 15, 2016—Approval number 4373090816 - https://www.udesc.br/cav/ceua.",
      "text": "An LCA was developed according to the ISO standards [23,24] and Food and Agriculture Organization of the United Nations (FAO) Livestock Environmental Assessment Protocol guidelines [25]. All procedures were approved by the ‘Comissão de Ética no Uso de Animais’ (CEUA/UDESC) on September 15, 2016—Approval number 4373090816 - https://www.udesc.br/cav/ceua."
