      "orig": "The CH4 emissions from enteric fermentation intensity (g (kg ECM)-1) was a function of estimated CH4 yield (g (kg DM intake)-1), actual DM intake and ECM. The enteric CH4 yield was estimated as a function of neutral detergent fiber (NDF) concentration on total DM intake, as proposed by Niu et al. [43], where: CH4 yield (g (kg DM intake)-1) = 13.8 + 0.185 × NDF (% DM intake).",
      "text": "The CH4 emissions from enteric fermentation intensity (g (kg ECM)-1) was a function of estimated CH4 yield (g (kg DM intake)-1), actual DM intake and ECM. The enteric CH4 yield was estimated as a function of neutral detergent fiber (NDF) concentration on total DM intake, as proposed by Niu et al. [43], where: CH4 yield (g (kg DM intake)-1) = 13.8 + 0.185 × NDF (% DM intake)."
